# Runtime config/data -- lives on Web01 only, never committed. state.json
# starts life as a one-time copy of state.template.json (see DEPLOY.md) and
# from then on is mutated live by draft_app.py; deploy.sh must never be able
# to touch it.
state.json
state.json.tmp
state.json.lock
pin.txt
secret_key.txt
anthropic_key.txt

# Generated pages -- regenerated on every pick, no reason to track them.
draft-board.html
draft-players.html
keep-protect.html

# Mock draft sandbox -- same story as state.json above, EXCEPT
# mock_state.seed.json, which IS tracked on purpose: it's the reusable
# starting point /mock/reset restores from, not live runtime data.
mock_state.json
mock_state.json.tmp
mock_state.json.lock

__pycache__/
*.pyc
